  "comments": [
    {
      "id": 4194835328,
      "path": ".github/workflows/Test-StyleGuideArtifacts.ps1",
      "line": 213,
      "body": "ConvertFrom-NulPathRecordStream scans the byte array twice: once to validate empty records and again to emit records. This is redundant work and increases complexity. Consider merging validation and emission into a single pass (validate `intIndex == intStart` before allocating/emitting each record).",
      "commit_id": "ed9eea201cfd70a88a6b982b29904e2f6206a692",
      "original_commit_id": "ed9eea201cfd70a88a6b982b29904e2f6206a692",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/franklesniak/TerraformStyleGuide/pull/68#discussion_r4194835328",
      "pull_request_review_id": 5427825804
    },
    {
      "id": 4194835388,
      "path": ".github/workflows/Generate-StyleGuideArtifacts.ps1",
      "line": 1308,
      "body": "When the executive summary top section is indexed into `$hashtableSections` under `$SummaryAnchor`, the same object is also present in `$listTopSections`. The later loop concatenates both collections, so that section can be processed twice. Consider deduplicating the sections before computing `CleanBody` (e.g., track a `[System.Collections.Generic.HashSet[object]]` of seen references) to avoid repeated work and reduce confusion.",
      "commit_id": "ed9eea201cfd70a88a6b982b29904e2f6206a692",
      "original_commit_id": "ed9eea201cfd70a88a6b982b29904e2f6206a692",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/franklesniak/TerraformStyleGuide/pull/68#discussion_r4194835388",
      "pull_request_review_id": 5427825804
    },
    {
      "id": 4194835424,
      "path": ".github/workflows/Generate-StyleGuideArtifacts.ps1",
      "line": 1320,
      "body": "When the executive summary top section is indexed into `$hashtableSections` under `$SummaryAnchor`, the same object is also present in `$listTopSections`. The later loop concatenates both collections, so that section can be processed twice. Consider deduplicating the sections before computing `CleanBody` (e.g., track a `[System.Collections.Generic.HashSet[object]]` of seen references) to avoid repeated work and reduce confusion.",
      "commit_id": "ed9eea201cfd70a88a6b982b29904e2f6206a692",
      "original_commit_id": "ed9eea201cfd70a88a6b982b29904e2f6206a692",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/franklesniak/TerraformStyleGuide/pull/68#discussion_r4194835424",
      "pull_request_review_id": 5427825804
    },
    {
      "id": 4194835467,
      "path": ".github/workflows/Test-StyleGuideArtifacts.ps1",
      "line": 577,
      "body": "This union-by-concatenation can include duplicate paths (a path present in both dictionaries is checked twice). Consider iterating a de-duplicated set of keys (e.g., build a hash set from both key collections) so the integrity check is strictly one comparison per path.",
      "commit_id": "ed9eea201cfd70a88a6b982b29904e2f6206a692",
      "original_commit_id": "ed9eea201cfd70a88a6b982b29904e2f6206a692",
      "html_url": "https://github.com/franklesniak/TerraformStyleGuide/pull/68#discussion_r4194835467",
      "pull_request_review_id": 5427825804
    }
